    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "For maximum efficiency, create the pixel buffers of tagged buffer groups using this pool with the [`CVPixelBufferPoolCreatePixelBuffer(_:_:_:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreVideo/CVPixelBufferPoolCreatePixelBuffer(_:_:_:)) function.",
      "ko": "최고 효율을 위해 이 풀에서 태그된 버퍼 그룹의 픽셀 버퍼를 [`CVPixelBufferPoolCreatePixelBuffer(_:_:_:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreVideo/CVPixelBufferPoolCreatePixelBuffer(_:_:_:)) 함수로 생성합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "8b6de0ceac0dbc39e4f5309ee6e990b624359e4887da933a81cc8b16d5c8724e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "The value of this property is `nil` before you call [`startWriting()`](avassetwriter/startwriting().md) on the associated [`AVAssetWriter`](avassetwriter.md) object.",
      "ko": "이 속성의 값은 연결된 [`AVAssetWriter`](avassetwriter.md) 객체에서 [`startWriting()`](avassetwriter/startwriting().md) 호출 전에 `nil`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "974d5b3f56c723587e361a7e8683ec69888fb93799fe38993428c1a2fdb4ca96",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "Query this property after writing starts to retrieve a `non-nil` value.",
      "ko": "쓰기 시작 후 이 속성을 조회하면 `non-nil` 값을 얻을 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ad26b21543d1e77f8aa541575b8aaa1f0f54d7e3cc9b599523d766a38bd430e3",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "This property is not key value observable.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 key-value 관찰이 지원되지 않습니다.",
